{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-6","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a number be parts of a number, and another be the same parts of another, the sum will also be the same parts of the sum that the one is of the one.","book":7,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","contentId":"euclid-7-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad7a595db22f29bc4bfc2cc93423d1016b26f281dc52bdfe26d1625f54590cc5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-6.statement","euclid-7-6.construction.1","euclid-7-6.proof.1","euclid-7-6.construction.2","euclid-7-6.proof.2","euclid-7-6.proof.3","euclid-7-6.conclusion","euclid-7-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a0f8affb13c4917a02b57a36fac9002ebd705639de87592cff4e47c7112c5547","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a number be parts of a number, and another be the same parts of another, the sum will also be the same parts of the sum that the one is of the one."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字是数字的一部分,而数字是数字的一部分,那么,总和也是数字的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22da9bf92edc415c91e9a2e08be83d5b9b45bc86764e2818208ea3a4f75e1ef1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the number AB be parts of the number C, and another, DE, the same parts of another, F, that AB is of C; I say that the sum of AB, DE is also the same parts of the sum of C, F that AB is of C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是C数字的一部分,DE是AB数字的一部分,AB数字是C数字的一部分;AB数字是C数字的一部分,F数字是C数字的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"749cb5e97473512e196104966e0b844f21b34aa88dfaabd6e89122ca31d3a24d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, whatever parts AB is of C, DE is also the same parts of F, therefore, as many parts of C as there are in AB, so many parts of F are there also in DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,无论AB部分为C部分,DE部分也是F部分,因此,C部分与AB部分相同,F部分也有DE部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"326b7331c1670a42614349bed91d64b1011657bb5c3a103e6d5de63692e3b35c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided into the parts of C, namely AG, GB, and DE into the parts of F, namely DH, HE; thus the multitude of AG, GB will be equal to the multitude of DH, HE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB分为C,即AG、GB和DE,即F,即DH、HE;因此,AG、GB将相当于DH、HE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"15ef7eac3cbb3bcb519b230c7972c287ccfc1deab725af3c2e898a4445a3e3e0","citations":["euclid-7-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, whatever part AG is of C, the same part is DH of F also, therefore, whatever part AG is of C, the same part also is the sum of AG, DH of the sum of C, F. [[VII. 5](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于,无论第AG部分是C部分,F部分也是DH部分,因此,第AG部分是C部分,F部分也是AG,DH。 [[VII. 5](/principles/euclid-7-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"67c0378902541571acee167703e0dd51f5f04b19999d8ed8ba038c7e24393348","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason, whatever part GB is of C, the same part also is the sum of GB, HE of the sum of C, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,无论第GB部分为C部分,同一部分也是GB,HE,C,F的总额。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f4336edcd2c47d9f6f7b70c0c1e6af3091e247732149d3cf115efa9cf97b55c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, whatever parts AB is of C, the same parts also is the sum of AB, DE of the sum of C, F. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无论第AB部分是C部分,同样部分也是AB,DE,C,Q。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-6.source","contentId":"euclid-7-6","revisionId":"euclid-7-6@raw-ad7a595db22f29bc","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8029c1be541a432a06f3c2005abffe2f88bdf971261a10d7472e58a37d7bad7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-6:euclid-7-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-6.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"VII. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-9:euclid-7-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-9","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VII. 5, 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-7-10:euclid-7-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-10","sourceBlockIds":[],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts